  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WeEmpower India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the action is to contribute to the Government of India&#xbf;s vision of a women-led development and more specifically to strengthen the economic and social rights of women and girls through a three-pronged approach, in view of strengthening EU Global Gateway strategy and actions in India in term of gender equality:This action will be implemented in close coordination and complementarity with other EU-funded or Team Europe Global Gateway actions and investments in India, such as Sustainable Finance, Renewable Energy, Sustainable Urbanisation, Digital, as well as trade and civil society projects.</narrative>
  </description>
